done them where somebody
can access it, if they get

00:24:57.430 --> 00:25:01.300
onboarded later, to really
keep that learning going?

00:25:01.300 --> 00:25:05.650
And how are you managing
that curriculum live

00:25:05.650 --> 00:25:07.090
versus not live?

