00:28:11.440 --> 00:28:14.500
of those early adopters.

00:28:14.500 --> 00:28:17.890
But it's easier said than done,
especially when you're the one

00:28:17.890 --> 00:28:23.850
that the content
is reflecting on.

00:28:23.850 --> 00:28:26.070
I see, Alan, you had a
question in the chat, too.

00:28:26.070 --> 00:28:28.645
If you want to jump in next.

00:28:28.645 --> 00:28:29.270
Yeah, thanks.

00:28:29.270 --> 00:28:30.350
Hi.

00:28:30.350 --> 00:28:34.280
I think my question is about the
communication and coordination

00:28:34.280 --> 00:28:40.340
between enterprise architecture
