00:28:40.340 --> 00:28:42.080
and how you figure out how--

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:47.120
if EA needs longitudinal
planning about structure

00:28:47.120 --> 00:28:49.130
and people and
resources and stuff,

00:28:49.130 --> 00:28:52.820
do you end up with
tension between being

00:28:52.820 --> 00:28:54.778
nimble at the R&amp;amp;D
level and knowing

00:28:54.778 --> 00:28:55.820
that you'll be supported?

00:28:55.820 --> 00:28:58.850
Like that someone will help keep
the lights on at the enterprise

00:28:58.850 --> 00:29:00.800
level for the
stuff you're doing.

00:29:00.800 --> 00:29:03.680
I think that's a little
different from the scaling-up

00:29:03.680 --> 00:29:05.960
question, but I'm not sure.

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:08.390
So how would you
figure out how to do

00:29:08.390 --> 00:29:11.975
that kind of planning together
where your cadences may not

